---
---

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">CYBERSECURITY | AUTOMATION | SYSTEMS DEVELOPMENT</p>

    <h1>Chad <span>Hamilton</span></h1>

    <p class="intro">
      Building adaptive systems across cybersecurity, automation, infrastructure,
      semantic tooling, physiological state modeling, and intelligent workflow design.
    </p>

    <div class="buttons">
      <a href="#projects">View Systems</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/icyNatural">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="projects" class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Energy Engine</h2>
      <p>
        A physiological and behavioral state system that interprets human energy patterns
        using sleep, HRV, activity, recovery, and temporal phase modeling.
      </p>
      <p>
        Focused on adaptive interpretation through evolving personal baselines,
        recovery patterns, and contextual state awareness rather than static averages alone.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Inquiry Engine</h2>
      <p>
        An adaptive inquiry and reasoning system designed to preserve continuity
        of thought across time.
      </p>
      <p>
        Focused on semantic retrieval, conceptual synthesis, long-term pattern tracking,
        and structured questioning rather than isolated AI conversations.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Potent Lexicon</h2>
      <p>
        A semantic language system for mapping words by sound, texture, atmosphere,
        symbolism, and meaning.
      </p>
      <p>
        Approaches language as dynamic cognitive structure shaped by association,
        perception, rhythm, context, and interpretive weight.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="technical">
    <p class="eyebrow">TECHNICAL BASE</p>

    <div class="base-grid">
      <div>IT Support</div>
      <div>Cybersecurity Research</div>
      <div>PowerShell Automation</div>
      <div>Systems Documentation</div>
      <div>HTML / CSS / JavaScript</div>
      <div>GitHub Pages</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #070b17;
    --panel: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.72);
    --border: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.16);
    --text: #eef2ff;
    --muted: #a5b4d4;
    --primary: #8b5cf6;
    --secondary: #60a5fa;
    --glow: 0 0 24px rgba(96,165,250,0.08), 0 0 60px rgba(139,92,246,0.08);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(96,165,250,0.12), transparent 30%),
      radial-gradient(circle at left, rgba(139,92,246,0.10), transparent 35%),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, #060816, #02040b);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  main {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 90px 10%;
  }

  .hero {
    max-width: 920px;
    margin-bottom: 90px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--secondary);
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(72px, 10vw, 118px);
    margin: 24px 0 18px;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -4px;
  }

  h1 span {
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #c4b5fd, #60a5fa);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 760px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 42px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .buttons a {
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    font-weight: bold;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .buttons a:first-child {
    color: white;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #8b5cf6, #3b82f6);
    box-shadow: var(--glow);
  }

  .buttons a:last-child {
    color: white;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }

  .buttons a:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 26px;
  }

  .card {
    border-radius: 30px;
    padding: 34px;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    box-shadow: var(--glow);
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, border 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    border-color: rgba(139,92,246,0.28);
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(96,165,250,0.12), 0 0 80px rgba(139,92,246,0.10);
  }

  .card h2 {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #dbeafe;
  }

  .card p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .technical {
    margin-top: 90px;
  }

  .base-grid {
    margin-top: 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .base-grid div {
    color: #dbeafe;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.045);
    border: 1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.14);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
